# ViewInspector Requirement for UI Tests

- All UI component tests require the ViewInspector package
- Add ViewInspector with: File > Add Packages... and enter https://github.com/nalexn/ViewInspector
- Add it only to the test target, not the main app
- Add `@Inspectable` to any SwiftUI view you want to test
- Import both SwiftUI and ViewInspector in test files

Example:
```swift
import XCTest
import SwiftUI
import ViewInspector
@testable import TheScanVault

extension MyView: Inspectable {}  // Make the view inspectable

class MyViewTests: XCTestCase {
    func testView() throws {
        let view = MyView()
        let sut = try view.inspect()
        // Test the view...
    }
}
```

- If you encounter build errors, check that ViewInspector is properly added to the test target
- ViewInspector documentation: https://github.com/nalexn/ViewInspector#readme
